Choose exactly one severity: critical, high, medium, low, unknown. Use unknown when the article does not support a reliable severity.
Write a factual English executive summary in no more than three short sentences.
Return only one JSON object with these exact keys: category, severity, summary_tr, confidence. Confidence must be a number from 0 to 1.

ARTICLE METADATA
